  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The proposed project will strengthen the management and operational capacity of Zenith Foods; provide working capital to purchase raw materials from farmers; strengthen the capacity of farmers to increase production of raw materials; commission the milling plant; and set up a mini laboratory.</narrative>
